  "sourceTitle": "Easy Feta & Zucchini Pie",
  "sourceText": "Easy Feta & Zucchini Pie\nBy: Alexia Papadopoulou\nPublished: Sunday, June 14, 2015 - 9:13am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\nEasy Zucchini & Feta cheese Pie\nINGREDIENTS:\n-2 lb. zucchini, grated\n-3 Eggs\n-2 cups of Feta cheese, crumbled\n-2 tbsp mint, chopped\n- Salt, Peeper\n-3 tbsp Olive oil\n-4 tbsp Flour\n\nPreparation\n\n1 DIRECTIONS: 2 Mix all ingredients to a mixing bowl. 3 Pour the mixture into a greased baking pan, and bake at 180 C  for 15 min, or until golden brown.",
